{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"specific-heat-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"specific-heat-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["specific-heat-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Per a un canvi de temperatura sense canvi de fase, useu Q = m· c· ΔT, on Q és l' energia tèrmica, m és la massa, c és la capacitat calorífica específica i ΔT és el canvi de temperatura. El mode de mescla assumeix propietats constants i un sistema aïllat ideal a menys que introduïu la pèrdua de calor.","record_id":"79f24f34fb0e817303040db166e500513a1c05af1744741fb5cac3762af7daf9","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41185047487","seconds":0.9911181907500577,"source":"For a temperature change without a phase change, use Q = m·c·ΔT, where Q is heat energy, m is mass, c is specific heat capacity and ΔT is the temperature change. The mixing mode assumes constant properties and an ideal insulated system unless you enter heat loss.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"58f5ef56917f18dfaeb1efbb580a92ee037185080b8182c3f9398f9cabbfb59f","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Per a un canvi de temperatura sense canvi de fase, useu Q = m· c· ΔT, on Q és l' energia tèrmica, m és la massa, c és la capacitat calorífica específica i ΔT és el canvi de temperatura. El mode de mescla assumeix propietats constants i un sistema aïllat ideal a menys que introduïu la pèrdua de calor.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
